# Trial-Size Trial by Fire (outlands 15): the battlefield won while completed (a re-run; the entry holds for a completed
# quest). A SMN of level 20 who knows Ifrit (spell 298), the quest completed and the Mini Tuning Fork (GMs): the
# fork's trade to FP_Entrance, option 17, IFRIT_PRIME_ASA-18 killed; 32001's finish: Ifrit known (no message), no
# scroll held: the Scroll of Instant Warp given (ITEM_OBTAINED), Windurst fame +20 again, completeQuest again (no change).
char zone=CloisterOfFlames pos=-720.631,-1.4,-597.955 job=SMN lvl=20
spell 298
quest Outlands.TrialSizeTrialByFire completed
item MiniTuningForkOfFire
login
trade FP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfFire x1  # completed: the entry menu 32000
update 32000 option=17                    # registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                    # in the arena
kill IFRIT_PRIME_ASA-18                   # won: 32001 (canSkipCS 1)
finish                                    # Ifrit known: nothing; the Scroll of Instant Warp; Windurst fame +20; completed again
